<Root>
  <DefaultMacro>
    <Major>Kingslayer reload grave/digger</Major>
    <Description>This is a automatic macro to reload the kingslayer gun in grave/digger
please note that this works better using run while held/run until pressed again as it repeats the same line allowing for a full reload

this wont work on spent cap chambers, you will have to manually input caps/ remove caps

First, enter reload on the kingslayer by pressing R once, then run the macro.
this macro: enters a cap into a *EMPTY* chamber, fills it up with the neccessary amount of gunpowder, enters a ball moves chamber and hammers the ball giving you a single shot. It is advised you use run while/held or run until pressed again to repeat this cycle as it will only do it once.

use this macro only when theres no spent caps in your Kingslayer.</Description>
    <Comment>game is listed in the description, you will still have to buy the actual gun.</Comment>
    <GUIOption>
      <RepeatType>0</RepeatType>
    </GUIOption>
    <KeyUp>
      <Syntax></Syntax>
    </KeyUp>
    <KeyDown>
      <Syntax>KeyDown 30 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 30 1
Delay 300 ms
KeyDown 31 1
Delay 2 s
KeyUp 31 1
Delay 1 s
KeyDown 20 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 20 1
Delay 500 ms
LeftDown 1
Delay 400 ms
LeftUp 1
Delay 200 ms
KeyDown 32 1
Delay 64
KeyUp 32 1
Delay 1500 ms</Syntax>
    </KeyDown>
    <Software>Roblox</Software>
  </DefaultMacro>
</Root>